\begin{align}
-\frac{1}{\rho_0} \partial_z P \approx -\frac{v_s^2}{\rho_0} (\rho_0 \phi)'' \approx -\frac{v_s^2}{\rho_0} \phi'' \, .
\end{align}
Thus, the equation of motion \eqref{NS-eq} reduces to, 
\begin{align}
\rho_0 \ddot{\phi} = -\frac{v_s^2}{\rho_0} \phi'' \, ,
\end{align}
which is Eq.~\eqref{normal-modes-eq} of the main text.

