[\delta(\sigma'-\tau_2)
-\delta(\sigma'-\tau_1)](\tau_1-\tau_2)\frac{u_\mu}{L}
\end{equation}
which produces eq. (84) in the text. Employing the notation $\left[\delta(\sigma-\sigma')
